ject\n- 2 Major issues → 不高于 Weak Accept\n- 1 Major issue → 不高于 Accept\n- 0 Major issues → 可给 Strong Accept\n每条 Major issue 必须有 explicit justification。如果最终评分高于校准基准，必须解释 override 理由。\n\n**报告格式要求**：\n请提供以下结构化报告：\n1. Summary（2-3 句概括论文贡献）\n2. Strengths（逐条列出）\n3. Weaknesses（逐条列出，标注 idea/presentation 层面 + Major/Minor）\n4. Questions to Authors\n5. Scores：Soundness (1-5), Excitement (1-5), Overall Assessment (1-5, 半分制), Confidence (1-5)\n6. 一句话 verdict\n\n请通过 `review_reviewer_post_to_director(text, reviewer_id=\"1\", project=\"ec_hte_llm_annotation\", dream_id=\"20260521T032758\")` 汇报。"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1319,"cache_read_input_tokens":54020,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1319},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2b69156a-32d2-4982-912e-ea43ee173131","uuid":"c903d16c-4bcc-416a-9fcd-b953cbf5841e"}
